                          <TARGET-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF DEST="VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE">/GM_SUM/Interfaces/PNC_ShutdownPermission/SUSD_UserRequest</TARGET-DATA-PROTOTYPE-REF>
